{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50815","headline":"登香炉峯寄远人 · 张祜","name":"登香炉峯寄远人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前登香炉峯，却指湓城郡。\n大江北潮海，崇岳南作镇。\n相逢虎溪子，轻策聊一振。\n水石动寒光，风松洒高韵。\n忧来月成语，忽忽千里愤。\n六朝空遗文，三国无尺烬。\n孤禽下云久，远树入烟尽。\n客恨猒山重，归心喜流顺。\n故执行潇湘别，即此无音信。\n憔悴十年心，谁人不缁磷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50815.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50815","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}